Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:20.45,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,AKAN MUNCUL ANGKA 1-6 SECARA ACAK\NMEMBERIKAN EFEK SESUAI ANGKA YANG MUNCUL
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:26.70,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SKILL TREE BADUT: LV13, SISA SKILL POINT: 0
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.16,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,AKROBAT BADUT 2/100, HOKI GILA 15/70
